---
layout: shell.njk
navKey: home
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-heading">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <p class="eyebrow">// SILENT·STAR — 关于 AI AGENT 的公开笔记<span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
    <h1 id="home-heading">我在公开构建<br>AI Agent。</h1>
    <p class="hero__english" lang="en">Building AI agents in public.</p>
    <p class="hero__copy">深度长文、代码教程与项目拆解，把我做 Agent 时踩过的坑、想明白的事，一篇篇写下来。</p>
    <p class="hero__aside" lang="en">Deep dives · tutorials · teardowns · source notes.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/archive/">浏览全部文章 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/feed.xml">订阅 RSS</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__metrics">
      <span>文章 {{ blog.posts.length }}</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>自 2026 起写作</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if blog.featured %}
<section class="home-section home-section--featured">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">// FEATURED</p>
        <h2>精选 <span lang="en">Featured</span></h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/archive/">全部 →</a>
    </header>
    <article class="featured-story">
      <div class="featured-story__content">
        <div class="featured-story__topline">
          <span>编辑推荐</span>
          {% if blog.featured.tags.length %}<a href="/tags/{{ blog.featured.tags[0] | tagPath | urlencode }}/">{{ blog.featured.tags[0] }}</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <h3><a href="{{ blog.featured.url }}">{{ blog.featured.title }}</a></h3>
        {% if blog.featured.description %}<p>{{ blog.featured.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        <div class="featured-story__meta">
          <time datetime="{{ blog.featured.date }}">{{ blog.featured.date | cnDate }}</time>
          <a href="{{ blog.featured.url }}">阅读全文 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="featured-story__rail" aria-label="精选文章信息">
        <p>EDITOR'S PICK <b>/ 01</b></p>
        <strong aria-hidden="true">01</strong>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>FORMAT</dt><dd>深度长文</dd></div>
          <div><dt>TOPICS</dt><dd>{{ blog.featured.tags.length }}</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <span>{{ blog.featured.slug }}.html</span>
      </aside>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
{% else %}
<section class="home-section">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">// WRITING</p>
        <h2>文章 <span lang="en">Writing</span></h2>
      </div>
    </header>
    <p class="empty">还没有文章。往 src/posts/&lt;slug&gt;/index.html 放一篇完整 HTML，就会出现在这里。</p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if blog.recent.length %}
<section class="home-section home-section--latest">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">// LATEST NOTES</p>
        <h2>最新文章 <span lang="en">Latest</span></h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/archive/">查看全部 →</a>
    </header>
    {% set items = blog.recent %}
    {% set compactList = true %}
    {% include "post-list.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="home-section home-section--topics">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">// TOPICS</p>
        <h2>按主题浏览 <span lang="en">Browse by topic</span></h2>
      </div>
    </header>
    <ul class="topic-grid topic-grid--primary">
      {% for group in blog.topics %}
      <li>
        <a href="/topics/{{ group.slug }}/">
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span><strong>{{ group.title }}</strong><small>{{ group.english }}</small></span>
          <b>{{ group.posts.length }}</b>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="content-frame about-grid">
    <div class="about-mark" aria-hidden="true">{{ site.title | upper }}</div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">// ABOUT</p>
      <h2>{{ site.title }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>独立开发者，记录 AI 工具、Agent 架构与工程实践。相信理解复杂系统最好的方式，是做一个能跑的最小版本，再把证据写清楚。</p>
      <p class="about-copy__english" lang="en">Independent notes on agents, tools, architecture, and the decisions behind working systems.</p>
      <div class="about-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/majiayu000">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a href="/feed.xml">RSS ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
